Privacy Policy — AI Google Forms Filler

Last updated: October 7, 2026

1. Summary
AI Google Forms Filler does not collect, sell or share your data with the developer
or any analytics, advertising or tracking service. The extension has no servers of its own.

2. What the extension accesses
- Google Forms pages (docs.google.com/forms): question texts, answer options and
  answers already selected, to build a prompt and to fill in the form.
- AI assistant tabs you choose (Gemini, Claude, ChatGPT, DeepSeek, Grok): the extension
  types the prompt into the chat and reads the assistant's reply.
- Titles and URLs of open tabs: only to detect whether a Google Form and the selected
  AI service are open.

3. Data sent to third-party AI services
When you press Start (or the "Ask AI" button next to a question), the question texts,
answer options and the text of the preset you selected are entered into the chat of the
AI service(s) you chose, using your own logged-in account. If your preset contains
personal information (for example your name or age), that text is sent to those
services too. These services process it under their own terms and privacy policies;
the developer has no access to those conversations. The extension never sends data
anywhere else.

4. Data stored locally
The following is stored only in your browser via chrome.storage.local:
- settings (interface language, delay, answer language, selected AI, options);
- your answer presets;
- a short activity log (up to 200 entries).
This data is not transmitted to the developer. You can delete presets and clear the log
inside the extension; uninstalling the extension removes all of it.

5. Permissions
- activeTab, scripting, host permissions for docs.google.com and the listed AI
  services: to read forms, fill answers and interact with the chosen AI chat.
- tabs: to find and open the form and AI tabs.
- storage: to save your settings and presets locally.

6. Limited use
Data accessed by the extension is used only to provide its single purpose: filling
Google Forms with AI assistance. It is not sold, not used for advertising, credit
or lending decisions, and not transferred to third parties except to the AI services
you explicitly select, as described in section 3.

7. Children
The extension is not directed to children under 13.

8. Changes
If this policy changes, the date above will be updated.

